    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1065">

                <pb facs="0917" n="801" xml:id="pg801"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/15640.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consul Simpich to the Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Nogales</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-08-04T14:00:00-07:23">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 4, 1915—2 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Attack on Maytorena’s outposts about Nogales has just begun. I saw Maytorena and
                    delivered usual warning as to firing across line. He says he has taken offensive
                    with artillery and can repel Carrancistas.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Simpich.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
